# Cloudflare Pages Redirects & Canonical Clean URLs
# Now that pages are organized into directories (/aboutus/index.html, etc.),
# Cloudflare Pages automatically serves the directory's index.html.
# These 301 redirects ensure any legacy .html requests smoothly redirect to clean URLs:

/aboutus.html               /aboutus/               301
/services.html              /services/              301
/dpf-cleaning-service.html  /dpf-cleaning-service/  301
/contactus.html             /contactus/             301
